{
  "id": "E070",
  "title": "Handling the Chinese Winter",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-11-30",
  "synopsis": "The way Chinese people handle the winter depends on where they live.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/287/4b426df230d5678fbfc6de3beb185363adc1beb8.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在中国怎么过冬？\n\n    中国很大，北方和南方很不一样。在北方，房子外面很冷，你要穿很厚的外套；可是房子里有暖气，不用穿外套。在南方，房子里没有暖气，有时候比外面冷，所以在家也要穿很多衣服。如果你在广州、海南，冬天的天气也很暖和，不用穿厚衣服。",
    "traditional": "在中國怎麼過冬？\n\n    中國很大，北方和南方很不一樣。在北方，房子外面很冷，你要穿很厚的外套；可是房子裡有暖氣，不用穿外套。在南方，房子裡沒有暖氣，有時候比外面冷，所以在家也要穿很多衣服。如果你在廣州、海南，冬天的天氣也很暖和，不用穿厚衣服。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How do you handle the winter in China?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "中国很大，北方和南方很不一样。",
      "traditional": "中國很大，北方和南方很不一樣。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó hěn dà běi fāng hé nán fāng hěn bù yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "在北方，房子外面很冷，你要穿很厚的外套；",
      "traditional": "在北方，房子外面很冷，你要穿很厚的外套；",
      "pinyin": "zài běi fāng fáng zi wài miàn hěn lěng nǐ yào chuān hěn hòu de wài tào",
      "english": "China is a really big country. The northern and southern parts are very different."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "可是房子里有暖气，不用穿外套。",
      "traditional": "可是房子裡有暖氣，不用穿外套。",
      "pinyin": "kě shì fáng zi lǐ yǒu nuǎn qì bú yòng chuān wài tào",
      "english": "In the northern part, it’s very cold outside and you need to wear a thick coat."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "在南方，房子里没有暖气，有时候比外面冷，",
      "traditional": "在南方，房子裡沒有暖氣，有時候比外面冷，",
      "pinyin": "zài nán fāng fáng zi lǐ méi yǒu nuǎn qì yǒu shí hou bǐ wài miàn lěng",
      "english": "However, they have heating systems and you don’t need to wear a coat inside."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "所以在家也要穿很多衣服。",
      "traditional": "所以在家也要穿很多衣服。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ zài jiā yě yào chuān hěn duō yī fu",
      "english": "In the southern part, since there are no heating systems indoors, it’s sometimes colder than outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "如果你在广州、海南，冬天的天气也很暖和，不用穿厚衣服。",
      "traditional": "如果你在廣州、海南，冬天的天氣也很暖和，不用穿厚衣服。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ zài guǎng zhōu hǎi nán dōng tiān de tiān qì yě hěn nuǎn huo bú yòng chuān hòu yī fu",
      "english": "Therefore you need to wear a lot of clothes at home."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you are in Guangzhou or Hainan, you don’t need to wear any thick clothes because it’s quite warm even in winter."
    }
  ],
