    "sentence_translations": [
      "How do you handle the winter in China?",
      "",
      "China is a really big country. The northern and southern parts are very different.",
      "In the northern part, it’s very cold outside and you need to wear a thick coat.",
      "However, they have heating systems and you don’t need to wear a coat inside.",
      "In the southern part, since there are no heating systems indoors, it’s sometimes colder than outside.",
      "Therefore you need to wear a lot of clothes at home.",
      "If you are in Guangzhou or Hainan, you don’t need to wear any thick clothes because it’s quite warm even in winter.",
      ""
